    <h1>An Introduction to My Dogs</h1>
<h3>Zelda and Ash</h3>
<body>
<p>We have two dogs named Zelda and Ash.</p>
<p>Zelda is <b>5 years old</b>, she was born in March. She's a mixed breed, her dad was a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernese_Mountain_Dog">Great Bernese Mountain Dog</a> and her mom is a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangal_Shepherd_Dog">Kangal Shepherd Dog</a> and a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyrenean_Mountain_Dog">Pyrenean Mountain Dog</a>. She is named after Princess Zelda from the <i>Legend of Zelda</i> series, I mentioned it one day to my Mom and she thought it would be a cute name. She is very sweet and protective, she will do anything for some love and affection.</p>
<p>Ash is only <b>8 months old</b>, we got him back in March, he was born in January. He is a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welsh_Corgi">Corgi</a>. He is named after Ash Ketchum from the <i>Pokemon</i> anime, because my dad's name is Brock.  He is very cute, but pretty mischevious as he is still a puppy. I remember somewhere online they said that corgis are really smart, which makes them bored easily, so he tends to get bored easy and gets into mischief.</p>
<p>My family are pretty big "dog people", we love our animals, and our dogs are part of it. We actually have a lot of animals, but our dogs are like part of our family.</p>
